<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Snap-On upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Snap-On upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman said analyst Joseph Phillippi upgraded Snap-On Inc to outperform from underperform.</p>
<p>-- Said the upgrade &quot;reflects the company's strong position in the automotive service tool and repair information business, and an improving competitive environment as industry consolidation has accelerated.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares were flat at 36-5/8.</p>
</text>
